af_scaletempo2 as it is in mpv 0.39.0.

mpv 0.36 changes the speed of the sound with this filter, as it was before
the fixes of 0.37: a change of speed gave a spike of too many or too few
samples and a jump in the timestamps (f52cf90fe), the first block was mixed
with whatever the buffer held (33d6d0f31), and the sound stayed off by up
to the search interval on the way back to 1x (c0728249a). Heard and seen
as a hitch when a long press at 2x or 3x begins and when it ends.
The three files are those of v0.39.0, unchanged; they use nothing that
0.36 does not have.

